                                                "sense_id": "6b7a9fc7-4756-336f-8953-aad5747b3082",
                                                "text": "You see, Sir, when I look at the Ace it reminds me that there is but one God. The deuce reminds me that the bible is divided into two parts; the Old and New Testaments. And when I see the trey I think of the Father, Son and Holy Ghost."
                                            }
